sequenceDiagram
  participant U as React UI
  participant A as FastAPI
  participant P as Pydantic
  participant S as Task Service
  participant D as PostgreSQL
  U->>A: POST /api/v1/tasks
  A->>P: Validate request
  alt Invalid payload
    P-->>U: 422 field errors
  else Valid payload
    P->>S: Typed task input
    S->>D: INSERT via SQLAlchemy
    D-->>S: Saved task
    S-->>A: Task DTO
    A-->>U: 201 JSON task
  end
  Note over U,D: Past due-date rejection is deferred (STORY-A).
